This is a static composition study, not a working related-card layout. It shows
one possible use of a **Project notes** context tab and two deliberately placed
cards tucked beneath the blue paper card.

![Static composition study of a blue paper card with a Project notes tab and two titled cards tucked beneath it](./stack-experiment.attach/stack.svg)

The two labels point to explicit sample inputs: [one note, three
stocks](./comparison.memo.card) and [quotes and
attribution](./quotes.memo.card). Their placement is authored inside the
illustration. The engine does not currently choose related cards or position a
stack automatically.
